{
  "_": [
    "Social regression pass on three real instances that start as strangers. Onboard",
    "FRESH first (fleet.ps1 -Onboard -Fresh -Peers a,b,c): a stable fixture carries its",
    "relay mailbox and roster along, and the precondition block refuses to run on it.",
    "",
    "(a) PROFILE AUDIENCE: a sets a status and an about-me in Settings > Profile. c, a",
    "    stranger, sends a request by ID. While it is PENDING, a's Requests tab names c",
    "    (c's signed card) and c's Sent row names a (a's card), but nothing on c's screen",
    "    carries a's status or about text. a then declines and c's Sent row goes away.",
    "    Weak spot: no desktop surface opens a profile from a request row, so the",
    "    expect_no_text can only see what c's Requests tab draws. The positive control",
    "    is in (b): once b is a FRIEND, b's friend row and DM profile panel show both",
    "    texts, so the same data does flow where the audience is Full.",
    "(c) NICKNAME, run before (b) because it makes the a/b request: a claims a temporary",
    "    nickname 'probe<RUN>' (3 to 20 lowercase letters, digits or underscores), b",
    "    types it on Add friend, confirms the 'Send a friend request to ...?' ask, and a",
    "    sees the request from probe-b. b does the lookup rather than c because c's",
    "    declined request would leave a 'declined' tombstone between a and c.",
    "(b) BLOCK: a accepts, a DM each way, b blocks a from the DM profile panel's More",
    "    menu (Block asks first, Unblock does not), a's DM never shows on b within 10 s,",
    "    b unblocks, a's next DM shows on b. The blocked DM may come back later through",
    "    catch-up sync, so it is only asserted absent WHILE blocked.",
    "(d) SAFETY NUMBER is skipped: fleet_destroy.ps1 G2 covers verify.",
    "Cleanup: b's block list emptied (only matters if the run died mid-block), a",
    "removes b (row More menu > Remove friend > confirm; there is no row icon for it),",
    "both lists end empty, a releases the nickname, leftover requests answered.",
    "",
    "run: powershell -File scripts/fleet.ps1 -Onboard -Fresh -Peers a,b,c",
    "     powershell -File scripts/fleet.ps1 -Scenario regress_social -Peers a,b,c"
  ],
  "peers": ["a", "b", "c"],
  "steps": [
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait_for", "provider": "connection", "equals": "connected", "timeout_ms": 120000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "capture", "from": "provider", "key": "peerId", "as": "PEER_A" },

    { "peer": "all", "op": "log", "message": "precondition: nobody is anyone's friend and nothing is waiting" },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Friends", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:No friends yet", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:No requests waiting", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(a) PROFILE AUDIENCE: a sets a status and an about-me (fields: name 0, status 1, about 2)" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Settings", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:SettingsPlace", "timeout_ms": 20000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:SettingsPlace > text:Profile", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "hint:What are you up to?", "timeout_ms": 20000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "hint:What are you up to?", "value": "busy-a-${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:_ProfileEditor > type:TextField", "index": 2, "value": "about-a-${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "text:You have unsaved profile changes", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:SettingsUnsavedBar > text:Save", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "text:You have unsaved profile changes", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "shot", "name": "rs-01-profile-saved", "soft": true },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Close settings", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:SettingsPlace", "timeout_ms": 10000 },

    { "peer": "c", "op": "log", "message": "(a) c, a stranger, sends a request to a by ID" },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "enter_text", "target": "hint:Paste an ID, or type a nickname", "value": "${PEER_A}" },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:${PEER_A}", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:Send request", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Cancel friend request", "timeout_ms": 15000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Accept friend request", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "a names c from c's card, not from a bare ID" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:probe-c", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "log", "message": "c names a from a's card, and the card carries no status and no about-me" },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:probe-a", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "expect_no_text", "value": "busy-a-${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "expect_no_text", "value": "about-a-${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "shot", "name": "rs-02-pending", "soft": true },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(a) a declines; c's Sent row has to go away" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Decline friend request", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:No requests waiting", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Cancel friend request", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(c) NICKNAME: a claims probe${RUN} on its Add friend tab" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "hint:Choose a nickname", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "hint:Choose a nickname", "value": "probe${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "reveal", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:Claim", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:Claim", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "Release only exists once the relay granted the claim" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:Release", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "shot", "name": "rs-03-nickname-claimed", "soft": true },

    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "(c) b looks the nickname up, confirms who it names, and sends" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "enter_text", "target": "hint:Paste an ID, or type a nickname", "value": "probe${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:Send request", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "dialog > text:Send a friend request to probe${RUN}?", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "shot", "name": "rs-04-nickname-confirm", "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "dialog > text:Send request", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "dialog", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Cancel friend request", "timeout_ms": 15000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Accept friend request", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:probe-b", "timeout_ms": 60000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(b) BLOCK: a accepts b, both lists converge" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Accept friend request", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:No requests waiting", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Friends", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:probe-b", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Cancel friend request", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Friends", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:probe-a", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "positive control for (a): a FRIEND's row shows the status c never saw" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:busy-a-${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "(b) a DM each way" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:probe-b", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:probe-b" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "value": "dm from a ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:MessageRow > text:dm from a ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 20000 },

    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "semantics:probe-a", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:probe-a" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:MessageRow > text:dm from a ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "positive control for (a): the DM profile panel shows a's status and about-me to a friend" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:DmProfilePanel > text:busy-a-${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:DmProfilePanel > text:about-a-${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "value": "dm from b ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:MessageRow > text:dm from b ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 20000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:MessageRow > text:dm from b ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 60000 },

    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "(b) b blocks a from the DM profile panel's More menu; Block asks first" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:DmProfilePanel > semantics:More", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "menu > text:Block", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "dialog > text:Block probe-a?", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "shot", "name": "rs-05-block-confirm", "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "dialog > text:Block", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "dialog", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait", "ms": 1000 },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "value": "dm while blocked ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:MessageRow > text:dm while blocked ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 20000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "never shows up: a fixed wait, then expect_no_text (wait_for gone only proves a disappearance)" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait", "ms": 10000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "expect_no_text", "value": "dm while blocked ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "shot", "name": "rs-06-blocked", "soft": true },

    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "(b) b unblocks (no confirm); a's next DM shows on b" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:DmProfilePanel > semantics:More", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "menu > text:Unblock", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "enter_text", "target": "type:ChatComposerRow > type:EditableText", "value": "dm after unblock ${RUN}" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "key", "value": "enter" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:MessageRow > text:dm after unblock ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 20000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:MessageRow > text:dm after unblock ${RUN}", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "all", "op": "shot", "name": "rs-07-unblocked", "soft": true },

    { "peer": "all", "op": "dump", "name": "regress_social" }
  ],
  "cleanup": [
    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "b's block list: only non-empty if the run died between Block and Unblock" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Settings", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:SettingsPlace", "timeout_ms": 15000, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:SettingsPlace > text:Security", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait", "ms": 800 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "reveal", "target": "text:Blocked users", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:BlockedUsersExpandRow > text:Manage", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:BlockedUserRow > text:Unblock", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Close settings", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:SettingsPlace", "timeout_ms": 10000, "soft": true },

    { "peer": "a", "op": "log", "message": "a removes b: the row's More menu, then the confirm (its title is 'Remove probe-b?')" },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Friends", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:More for probe-b", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "menu > text:Remove friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "dialog > text:Remove probe-b?", "timeout_ms": 5000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "dialog > text:Remove friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:No friends yet", "timeout_ms": 30000 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:Release", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Decline friend request", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Cancel friend request", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "a", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },

    { "peer": "b", "op": "log", "message": "the removal has to reach b's list too" },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Friends", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > text:No friends yet", "timeout_ms": 60000 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Cancel friend request", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Decline friend request", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "b", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 },

    { "peer": "c", "op": "log", "message": "c: nothing should be left, but answer anything that is" },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "semantics:Add friend", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "target": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 15000 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > type:_TabBar > semantics:Requests", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Cancel friend request", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Decline friend request", "index": 0, "soft": true },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "tap", "target": "type:_FriendsManager > semantics:Close", "index": 0 },
    { "peer": "c", "op": "wait_for", "gone": "type:_FriendsManager", "timeout_ms": 10000 }
  ]
}
